{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_860.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"3f9fd23829a7e2417cba530f93b82894b72acbee7f7eed1f0582cdc5aba45196","ja":"ただいまーっ。\nたまきの撮影、終わったぞーっ！","zh":"我回来啦——！\n环的拍摄结束啦——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_860.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"fb197d2361158bd666da7dba9fef296ebba7e4b174ebad2c32fbe82b602db9b9","ja":"おつかれさま、環ちゃん！\n撮影、うまくいった？","zh":"辛苦了，小环！\n拍摄顺利吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_860.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"282000efaf28992f939fb57ff1b66bc3eeb8f307bff9fd0c33570421f86dc238","ja":"うん！　たまき、笑顔がいいねって\nカメラマンさんにほめられたんだ！","zh":"嗯！摄影师夸奖我说，环的笑容很棒呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_860.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"a28dd21eb8de60689a2fe436211ccaa93f904923a036ae382270d668fddb8e40","ja":"でもなんか、おやぶんが元気なくて……。\nなにかあったのかな？　たまき、心配だぞ。","zh":"可是，总觉得老大好像没什么精神……。\n是不是发生什么事了？环担心你。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_860.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"7509a8f1fb46519d1a74b60611709c9ccd148adf3a3e1d48341523e48b3401a9","ja":"お兄ちゃん、またぼんやりしてたの？\nまったく、今日はずっとそうなんだから。","zh":"哥哥，你又在发呆吗？\n真是的，今天一直都是这样。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_860.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"659637a2a2dd80ec6c760c44c92748936303fb2b8c017c17d548b6edb6c1210e","ja":"えっ？　そうなんだ……。\n●●●●プロデューサーさん、具合が悪いのかな？","zh":"咦？是这样啊……\n●●●●制作人先生，是不是身体不舒服？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_860.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"818145cdcedcc8655b945f42784a66aa6a26fc3bc71b2e8aac19893ff094855d","ja":"ううん。ただの寝不足だよ。","zh":"不，只是睡眠不足而已。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_860.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"99b1726aba103ae011317590e82f5066ae505fd5f809e7882fffa2f77db9366a","ja":"昨日、徹夜でプレゼン資料作ってて\n全然、眠れなかったんだって。","zh":"听说昨天熬夜做演示资料，完全没睡着。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_860.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"84db4021fc7223d6e152fab5e54e196b631d77e51aa8150f96d3907274c1a600","ja":"おかげでずっと上の空。桃子の話も聞いてないし。\n……だから、環や育が心配しなくても大丈夫だからね。","zh":"多亏了这个，我一直心不在焉的，连桃子说的话都没听进去。  \n……所以，环和育不用担心，没事的哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_860.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"66612f02fd801a2269a3d718957901afec58f63dd733e263ccc02462d2df4967","ja":"そうなの？　でも、これからまた打ち合わせがあるって\n言ってたぞ。おやぶん、起きてられるかな？","zh":"是这样吗？可是，她说接下来还有会议。大老板，你还能保持清醒吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_860.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"20d2f0839cf3233421fc8f3ca6a012faaf53c0bbcfa67e143363e0cf45f168ba","ja":"寝不足なのも、お仕事頑張ってくれたからだし、\n●●●●プロデューサーさん、かわいそうだよね。","zh":"你会睡眠不足，也是因为一直努力工作嘛，  \n●●●●制作人，真可怜啊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_860.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"25f2a7203f94286d833142f136e6ebb3641b440158942e65bcd6fc84cd3d855d","ja":"わたしたちで、●●●●プロデューサーさんに\nしてあげられることないかな？","zh":"我们能不能为●●●●制作人做点什么呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_860.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"86030856b2fb7d41d58c61e275113fd14aec5620175df2b64a6659ed87db54cf","ja":"おやぶん、仮眠室に行ったと思うぞ。\n打ち合わせまで寝てるのかも……行ってみよう。","zh":"我觉得老大去午睡室了。\n说不定会一直睡到碰头会……去看看吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_860.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"7381ac17aafa3f4032fbe459edfa8505ae7d30f305ec8eef3113654f21e61b20","ja":"もう……。\nふたりとも、お兄ちゃんに甘すぎなんだから……。","zh":"真是的……  \n你们两个对哥哥太纵容了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
